  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A common tool among bullies, this \"curse\" binds a creature's legs as if they were tied together with rope. A creature you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have its speed halved and suffer disadvantage on Dexterity saving throws. Additionally, each time it moves within the duration, it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw without disadvantage from this spell, or be knocked prone and take 2d4 bludgeoning damage.</p>",
